---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import AdSlot from '@/components/AdSlot.astro'; import { getCollection, render } from 'astro:content';
export async function getStaticPaths(){return (await getCollection('airports')).map(a=>({params:{id:a.id},props:{a}}))}
const {a}=Astro.props; const {Content}=await render(a); const d=a.data; const schema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Service',name:d.name,description:d.tagline,url:d.affiliateUrl};
---
<BaseLayout title={`${d.name} 资料与套餐`} description={d.tagline} type="article" schema={schema}><header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">机场资料 · 更新于 {d.checkedAt.toLocaleDateString('zh-CN')}</span><h1>{d.name}</h1><p>{d.tagline}</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href={d.affiliateUrl} rel="nofollow sponsored">访问服务商 <span class="badge ad">推广链接</span></a><a class="btn" href="/rankings/">返回排行榜</a></div></div></header><div class="container article-shell"><article class="prose"><div class="notice">价格仅在指定参考榜单存在对应项目时展示；未找到对应价格的项目标记为“待核实”。实际价格与套餐请以服务商结算页为准。</div><div class="card" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="score">{d.price===null?'价格待核实':`¥${d.price}`}<small>{d.price===null?'':' / 月起'}</small></div><div class="facts"><div class="fact"><small>常规月流量</small>{d.traffic}</div><div class="fact"><small>一次性订阅</small>{d.oneTime}</div><div class="fact"><small>线路</small>{d.protocols.join(' / ')}</div><div class="fact"><small>优惠码</small>{d.coupon??'无'}</div></div></div><Content/><h2>资料说明</h2><p>常规月流量采用 100–130 GB 的入门套餐展示口径。前八名标注支持一次性订阅，后续项目暂标记待观察。</p></article><aside class="toc"><AdSlot label="评测页合作位"/><div class="card" style="margin-top:16px"><strong>购买提醒</strong><p class="muted">优先小额试用，确认线路倍率、流量重置日期、设备限制和退款规则。</p></div></aside></div></BaseLayout>
